    "detailed_description": "Get ready to push your limits in the most challenging racing championship yet! Fog Racing Circuit introduces a new tournament that will test even the most seasoned drivers. This isn't just about speed\u2014it's about survival in extreme conditions. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nForget rain, snow, or hail; this time, it's the thick, impenetrable fog that will keep your foot off the gas. With visibility at an all-time low, only the most daring will thrive. If your eyesight is sharp and your nerves are steel, you might have the edge you need to outpace the competition. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut beware, danger lurks just 100 meters ahead, and you\u2019ll never know what\u2019s coming until it\u2019s almost too late. Master the treacherous tracks and claim your title as the ultimate risk-taker and champion of the Fog Racing Circuit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMain Game Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Three Intense Game Modes: Single Race, Championship, and Free Play.<br />\r\n- 10 Challenging Levels: Each one more treacherous than the last.<br />\r\n- Dynamic Weather: Experience the thrill and danger of racing in extreme fog conditions.",
